              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanda Musa giyooda, ak gagatkat googeal humng'eeda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda siikeal humng'eeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; nih saruuta Musa gil was lagweenda siiroor, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
